#: RASTATIME 2026-11-03 archiving stage 3 (archive automatically)
msgid "Every new episode is archived on cba.media with the recording, as set above, once the waiting time after its end has passed (Settings → Archiving). Not for rebroadcasts or episodes marked \"Do not archive this episode automatically\"; episodes that ended before switching on are not caught up."
